<title>USA: Executive Telecard names Balinger CEO.</title>
<headline>Executive Telecard names Balinger CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PEARL RIVER, N.Y. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Executive TeleCard Ltd said on Wednesday that Anthony Balinger, currently president, has been additionally named chief executive officer.</p>
<p>The CEO position had been vacant since 1994 when the then chief executive Bill Moore retired, the company said.</p>
